<div style="width:1440px; box-sizing:border-box; padding:48px 40px 44px; background:#f8f6f2;">
  <p class="lbl" style="color:#b07a3c; margin-bottom:8px;">Structure</p>
  <p class="disp" style="font-size:38px; margin-bottom:12px;">The three cases, pulled apart</p>
  <p class="body" style="max-width:900px; color:#6b6057; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:20px;">Every block maps to a <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; font-size:14px; color:#1e1a16;">::: section</span> marker in work.md, so the copy stays editable in Obsidian. Block labels come from each case&rsquo;s <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; font-size:14px; color:#1e1a16;">-meta</span> block, so a new named section needs no template change.</p>
  <div style="display:flex; gap:26px; align-items:center; padding:14px 0 34px; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da; margin-bottom:34px;">
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><div style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#b07a3c;"></div><p class="cap" style="font-size:12px;">My call</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><div style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid #3f7d7a; box-sizing:border-box;"></div><p class="cap" style="font-size:12px;">The team&rsquo;s work</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><div style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#1e1a16;"></div><p class="cap" style="font-size:12px;">Solo, nobody else in the room</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><polygon points="5,0 10,5 5,10 0,5" fill="#b07a3c"></polygon></svg><p class="cap" style="font-size:12px;">Copy that must survive the layout pass</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><div style="width:14px; height:11px; background:#f3ede4; border:1px solid #d8cec0;"></div><p class="cap" style="font-size:12px;">Diagram, not prose</p></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:40px; align-items:start;">
    <div><div style="padding-bottom:14px; border-bottom:2px solid #b07a3c; margin-bottom:20px;"><p class="lbl" style="color:#b07a3c; margin-bottom:6px;">Case one &middot; Toyota Connected Europe</p><p class="disp" style="font-size:26px;">The organisation</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-meta</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Opener band, reversed out</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Number, title, company and dates, role line. Full-bleed dark. The first of six landmarks on the page.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-stats</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Four numbers, in the band</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">0 to 40+ &middot; &pound;10m+ &middot; 1 of 3 &middot; #1. Set in the display face so they read at scroll speed.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-challenge</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The challenge</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Two paragraphs. Rail label plus 640px measure.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-role</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">My role</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">One paragraph. Sold every engagement, hired every person.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-narrative</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">How the capability grew &nbsp;<span style='color:#b5a08a'>&larr; label set in -meta</span></p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Paragraphs one and two: service design did not exist; it was not the first thing built.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The capability arc</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Four steps on a rising baseline, a hinge before the fourth, a widening scope wedge beneath. The best diagram on the page.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-narrative</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The turn, plus the pull-quote</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Paragraph three, with &ldquo;a disjointed end-to-end experience is usually a faithful reflection of a disjointed business&rdquo; set large.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The joins nobody owned</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Dark band. Journey slices, owners, and the four unowned joins. This is how service design is shown without a blueprint.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-narrative</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Making the case, and what outlasted it</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Paragraphs four to six. Carries the service designers&rsquo; credit for the blueprints and patterns.</p><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-top:10px; padding-top:9px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da;"><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" style="flex-shrink:0;"><polygon points="5,0 10,5 5,10 0,5" fill="#b07a3c"></polygon></svg><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b07a3c; margin:0;">Load-bearing copy, must survive</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The operating model</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Six disciplines, four engagement models plotted on breadth against duration, catalogue and P&amp;L beneath.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-approach</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">How it was run</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Seven items as a two-column definition grid. Bold lead, then the detail.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-hard</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The hardest part</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Distributed cohesion, then the programme that closed overnight.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case1-impact</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">What changed</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Displaced the agencies, retention, half contract to two thirds permanent.</p></div></div></div>
    <div><div style="padding-bottom:14px; border-bottom:2px solid #3f7d7a; margin-bottom:20px;"><p class="lbl" style="color:#3f7d7a; margin-bottom:6px;">Case two &middot; MyToyota and Lexus Link+</p><p class="disp" style="font-size:26px;">What the organisation shipped</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-meta</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Opener band, reversed out</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Number, title, company and dates. The role line names the design manager and the design leads and sits in the band, not below it.</p><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-top:10px; padding-top:9px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da;"><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" style="flex-shrink:0;"><polygon points="5,0 10,5 5,10 0,5" fill="#b07a3c"></polygon></svg><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b07a3c; margin:0;">Load-bearing copy, must survive</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-stats</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Four numbers, in the band</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">2,321 &middot; 4 rounds &middot; 1st &middot; 13 months. Three of the four are things I funded, not things I drew.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-challenge</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The challenge</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">1.9 stars. Design dominated the complaint list. Ends on the line that this case tests whether case one was worth building.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-role</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">&ldquo;I did not design this app&rdquo;</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Framed callout, display face, own band of white space. The paragraph after it survives intact.</p><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-top:10px; padding-top:9px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da;"><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" style="flex-shrink:0;"><polygon points="5,0 10,5 5,10 0,5" fill="#b07a3c"></polygon></svg><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b07a3c; margin:0;">Load-bearing copy, must survive</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-approach</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">What I did instead</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Six items. Won it, staffed it, argued research in, framed the two problems, held the bar, backed the system.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The research that bought the right to redraw</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">2,321 surveyed, 266 reviews, 19 interviews, 20 hours contextual, 4 dealership visits, 12 teardowns. A data strip, not prose.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-hard</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">What the team built &nbsp;<span style='color:#b5a08a'>&larr; label set in -meta</span></p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Section opens with the teal spine and stays inside it until the credit line. Everything here is theirs.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">One EV domain in place of four</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Before and after information architecture, drawn as blocks. No screenshots.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Four rounds against the same task set</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">SUS 73, 79, 80, with the target and global average marked.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-hard</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">My Garage, the switcher, the system</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Removal of My Garage, the vehicle switcher, unified climate, and the first design system in any Toyota app.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-hard</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The credit line</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Named on request, and among the references I would offer. Closes the teal section.</p><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-top:10px; padding-top:9px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da;"><svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" style="flex-shrink:0;"><polygon points="5,0 10,5 5,10 0,5" fill="#b07a3c"></polygon></svg><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b07a3c; margin:0;">Load-bearing copy, must survive</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Thirteen months</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Dark band. Four beats, and design leaving the top five complaint categories.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The rating turnaround</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">1.9 to 4.6, and the composition of reviews before and after. Public data.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case2-impact</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">What changed, and what it proves</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Ends on: the organisation produced a commercial outcome without me touching the work.</p></div></div></div>
    <div><div style="padding-bottom:14px; border-bottom:2px solid #1e1a16; margin-bottom:20px;"><p class="lbl" style="color:#1e1a16; margin-bottom:6px;">Case three &middot; PrepCall</p><p class="disp" style="font-size:26px;">The craft</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #1e1a16; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case3-meta</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Opener band, reversed out</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Number, title, PrepCall, 2026. Role line: solo, every decision mine, including the bad ones.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #1e1a16; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case3-stats</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Four numbers, in the band</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">5.6k to 34k+ &middot; 20 min &middot; Article 5 &middot; 1 person.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #1e1a16; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case3-challenge</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">The challenge</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Twenty five years of directing the work, and a question that stopped being answerable from the sidelines.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:3px; background:#f3ede4; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.11em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0 0 8px;">Diagram</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Context growth</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">5,600 characters at session one to over 34,000 by session four, and the bounded ceiling that fixed it.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #1e1a16; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case3-approach</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">What I learned building it</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Four items. The failure, the architectural fix, Article 5 as a design input, signal is not meaning.</p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="border:1px solid #e8e2da; border-left:3px solid #1e1a16; border-radius:3px; background:#fdfcfa; padding:14px 16px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; color:#b5a08a; margin:0 0 6px;">::: case3-impact</p><p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 5px; line-height:1.35;">Where it stands</p><p style="font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Live, in market, no revenue and no paying customers. Craft evidence rather than a business.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="cap" style="margin-top:36px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da; max-width:900px;">Case three is deliberately the shortest column. It is craft evidence, not a third organisational argument, and giving it equal length would overstate it.</p>
</div>